[?2004l[?2004h> - Working parallel UPC executable named '"'"'pgen'"'"' 
[?2004l[?2004h> - Makefile for compilation
[?2004l[?2004h> - Output files (/app/serial.out and /app/pgen_*.out) showing identical contigs between serial and parallel versions'; tmux wait -S done
